		(property "Note" "Rear side, THT side entry (4.8 mm tall), body beside the pack, soldered from the front outside the LED field; the only rear part besides the battery. Pin 1 = BAT-, pin 2 = BAT+ per Adafruit's own charger design (Micro-Lipo USB-C CN2: pin 1 GND, pin 2 VBAT) and Adafruit's statement that product 328 matches its boards; meter-check the pack before first connection"
